      "id": "sol.amc-8-2011-p9.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Carmen travels \\(35\\) miles in \\(7\\) hours, so her average speed is \\(\\frac{35}{7} = 5\\) miles per hour.\n\nThus, E is the correct answer.",
